  "description": "It’s Baekyoung’s 10th day as a succubus and she’s hangry for a meal. As a matter of fact, she’s getting downright desperate. Of course, a gourmet meal would be preferred but at this point any man will do, she just needs some sustenance. Ah, that guy right there! He looks a little nerdy but he’ll do for now. But it turns out that this meal will be much juicier than Baekyoung ever anticipated and now she can’t get this human off of her mind. The ravenous succubus has found her perfect meal, now she just has to make him all hers!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes one special and seven side story chapters.*",
